\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces  \small  The figure shows the average reward over $5{,}000$ training episodes for four different configurations of the DQN agent on the Arkanoid environment. All configurations start with similar low rewards and begin to diverge around episode $2{,}000$. The configurations with density reward (\textit  {yes\_density}) tend to achieve higher average rewards, with \textit  {no\_shaping\_yes\_density} reaching the peak around episode 4500. The \textit  {yes\_shaping\_no\_density} configuration shows the weakest performance in the later episodes.}}{57}{figure.caption.53}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:training}{{6.1}{57}{\small The figure shows the average reward over $5{,}000$ training episodes for four different configurations of the DQN agent on the Arkanoid environment. All configurations start with similar low rewards and begin to diverge around episode $2{,}000$. The configurations with density reward (\textit {yes\_density}) tend to achieve higher average rewards, with \textit {no\_shaping\_yes\_density} reaching the peak around episode 4500. The \textit {yes\_shaping\_no\_density} configuration shows the weakest performance in the later episodes}{figure.caption.53}{}}
